<rdfs:comment rdf:ID="_ECC8574947AF773C_rdfs.comment_A43B02CC3EDE237A">Belongs to the protein kinase superfamily. TKL Ser/Thr protein kinase family. RAF subfamily.</rdfs:comment>
</rdf:Description>
